<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-RAIN STOPS PLAY AT BARCELONA OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RAIN STOPS PLAY AT BARCELONA OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain stopped play in the quarter-finals of the Barcelona Open on Friday.</p>
<p>Albert Costa of Spain was leading France's Cedric Pioline 5-3 in the first set of their match when the rain began. Tournament officials said they did not expect the stoppage to last long.</p>
